    "description": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n  <head>\n     <style>\n       .desc-container {\n         display: flex;\n         flex-direction: column;\n         padding: 16px 13px;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row {\n         display: flex;\n         align-items: center;\n         margin-bottom: 16px;\n         border-bottom: 1px solid #efefef;\n         padding: 4px 0;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row-item-title {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 22px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n\n       .desc-row-item-content {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 18px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n     </style>\n  </head>\n\n  <body>\n<div class=\"desc-container\">\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">01.</span></div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><strong>Live Lectures</strong>&nbsp;by 2 Set of Faculties &amp; Class&nbsp;Notes Will be provided.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">02. <strong>NCERT Punch Videos</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> &amp; <strong>DPPs Discussion by Batch Faculty</strong></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">03. <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Digital Preparation KIT :</strong> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span></span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">A) Chapterwise Audio Summary &amp; Handwritten Notes<br />B) Chapterwise PYQ &amp; JEE Replica sheets (Main + Advanced) <br />C) Blueprints (Weightage analysis) &amp; Lecturewise Concise Notes<br />D) Digital Books<br /></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">04.</span></div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><strong>Scheduled tests &amp; AITS </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">will be held according to the planner</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">05. <strong>Revision Classes </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">will be provided after syllabus completion</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">06.</span></div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">Commitment Diary will be given after 20th March at the nearest VP / Pathshala Centre (first 1 lakh students only)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">07.</span></div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The complete course will be accessible to all students until </span><strong>JEE 2028 Exams</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">08.</span></div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">For App/Web Navigation the latest Feature Updates &amp; Student Support please subscribe to our Support YouTube channel:</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pwstudentsupport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/@pwstudentsupport</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">09.</span></div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The registration fee is included in the price of the batch which is showing on the website. The breakup of registration fee will be mentioned on invoice. You may be provided with access to Notes, PYQ&rsquo;s. Mock Test Papers, AITS Test Series, Previous year batches &amp; other materials, the access can vary depending on the batch you purchase, so that exact details might change from one batch to another.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
