    "shortDescription": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n <head>\n   <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n   <style>\n     .description-meta-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 14px !important;\n     }\n\n     .child-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       align-items: center !important;\n       gap: 12px !important;\n     }\n\n     .icon {\n       width: 32px !important;\n       height: 32px !important;\n     }\n\n     .sub-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .main-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 600 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 4px !important;\n     }\n   </style>\n </head>\n <body>\n<div class=\"description-meta-container\">\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/f463046e-0ed5-43b3-981c-944985082135.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\">Course Duration: </span> <span class=\"main-text\">Bridge Course Start : 03 April 2026<br />Syllabus Class Start : 13 April 2026<br />Syllabus Class End : 31 January 2027</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/972706bc-b79b-41e5-99b4-230290bd296c.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\"> Validity: </span> <span class=\"main-text\">30 June 2028</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" /><strong>Mode of Lectures:</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Live Online</span><br /><span class=\"text\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" /><strong>Schedule: </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 Classes/Per day, Classes will be held for 5 days/per week</span><br /><span class=\"text\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" /> Exam guidance at our PW Offline centers<span class=\"text\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" /> One-to-one emotional well-being support by PW Prerna counselors<span class=\"text\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" /> In-person support and helpdesk at PW Offline centers<span class=\"text\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/a5affa35-0c73-4ca1-8600-65d7ca8a328b.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\"> Subjects: Physics, Chemistry &amp; Maths.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
